  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526376",
      "title": "v-model & Inputs",
      "lectureOrder": 143,
      "videoOrder": 124,
      "sourceHash": "d3c33c2c267b88c388c16f784d7cb8bee16decb78506fcf79aca173dd395b084",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 5.23,
          "en": "And for that as so often,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.23,
          "end": 9.18,
          "en": "you find a starting project attached, downloaded, extracted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "Run npm install and then npm run serv",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 13.77,
          "en": "once you installed all dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.77,
          "end": 17.58,
          "en": "And this brings up the development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 19.89,
          "en": "Once this up and running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.89,
          "end": 22.9,
          "en": "this is what you should see on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.9,
          "end": 26.77,
          "en": "Now here I prepared a very basic form for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.77,
          "end": 29.32,
          "en": "We got input field for a text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.32,
          "end": 31.42,
          "en": "input field for a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.42,
          "end": 32.81,
          "en": "We got a drop down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.81,
          "end": 36.83,
          "en": "we got some check boxes and we got some radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.83,
          "end": 40.09,
          "en": "And then also a button to submit the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.09,
          "end": 44.29,
          "en": "Now let's first of all focus on how we can connect view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.29,
          "end": 45.43,
          "en": "to all those inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.43,
          "end": 48.39,
          "en": "and get information out of these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.39,
          "end": 51.11,
          "en": "Since this is probably something you'll need a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.11,
          "end": 52.72,
          "en": "in apps you're building.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.72,
          "end": 56.63,
          "en": "Let's there after talk about form validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.63,
          "end": 59.6,
          "en": "and how we can add basic validation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.6,
          "end": 64.49,
          "en": "And let's at the end, also build our own form control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.49,
          "end": 68.31,
          "en": "But step by step, here's TheForm.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 71.42,
          "en": "And here you see all the markup for the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.42,
          "end": 73.5,
          "en": "you see here on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 77.13,
          "en": "Now this component has no script logic at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 80.55,
          "en": "It just has a template and some styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.55,
          "end": 84.06,
          "en": "So let's actually get started by adding a script object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 87.64,
          "en": "and let's start by extracting some data out of these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.64,
          "end": 88.57,
          "en": "And for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.57,
          "end": 91.68,
          "en": "I will simply log that data to the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.68,
          "end": 93.983,
          "en": "so that we see that extraction worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.84,
          "end": 97.85,
          "en": "So we will need a method for that of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.85,
          "end": 101.62,
          "en": "which is triggered when the form is submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.62,
          "end": 104.12,
          "en": "and I'll name it submitForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.12,
          "end": 105.47999999999999,
          "en": "That's my method name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 108.44,
          "en": "And that's something we already did in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.44,
          "end": 110.88,
          "en": "We can now trigger this method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.88,
          "end": 113.97999999999999,
          "en": "when this form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.97999999999999,
          "end": 116.50999999999999,
          "en": "We could also add a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.50999999999999,
          "end": 118.28,
          "en": "to the button we have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.28,
          "end": 121.25,
          "en": "But since buttons, inside of forms,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.25,
          "end": 125.41,
          "en": "submit those forms and trigger the submit events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.41,
          "end": 129.71,
          "en": "you typically wanna listen to those submit events instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.71,
          "end": 133.03,
          "en": "And here, that's also something you already saw quite a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.03,
          "end": 133.863,
          "en": "in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.863,
          "end": 137.32999999999998,
          "en": "Here, you typically add the prevent modifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.32999999999998,
          "end": 140.52,
          "en": "to ensure that when form submission occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 143.1,
          "en": "we don't have that browser default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.1,
          "end": 145.78,
          "en": "Which would be that a request is sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.78,
          "end": 149.18,
          "en": "and which would therefore result in a page reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.18,
          "end": 151.32,
          "en": "which in the end restarts our view app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.32,
          "end": 153.97,
          "en": "and we therefore lose all our data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.97,
          "end": 155.753,
          "en": "That's definitely not what we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.81,
          "end": 161.4,
          "en": "So here I wanna trigger the submitForm method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.4,
          "end": 164.2,
          "en": "and now let's see how we can connect view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.2,
          "end": 165.893,
          "en": "to those different inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.27,
          "end": 171.43,
          "en": "Now let's start with the text input here for the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.43,
          "end": 176.43,
          "en": "We have two main ways of getting data out of such an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.52,
          "end": 179.96,
          "en": "Option one, is that we use the model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.96,
          "end": 184.73,
          "en": "or our own custom input event listener for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.73,
          "end": 187.01,
          "en": "to listen to every keystroke",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.01,
          "end": 190.78,
          "en": "and store what's the user entered in some data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.78,
          "end": 192.063,
          "en": "with every keystroke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.05,
          "end": 196.35,
          "en": "This is perfectly fine and especially useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.35,
          "end": 199.6,
          "en": "if you maybe also want to validate this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.6,
          "end": 202.4,
          "en": "on every keystroke to show an error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.4,
          "end": 205.28300000000002,
          "en": "even before the user tries to submit anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.63,
          "end": 209.49,
          "en": "In addition, if you use the model,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.49,
          "end": 212.01,
          "en": "you of course have two way binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.01,
          "end": 215.23,
          "en": "which can also help with resetting the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.23,
          "end": 216.7,
          "en": "With two way binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.7,
          "end": 219.61,
          "en": "you can not just listen to what the user entered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.61,
          "end": 222.5,
          "en": "but you can also overwrite what's in the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.5,
          "end": 225.35,
          "en": "and you can change the value which is stored in the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.35,
          "end": 227.423,
          "en": "And that also can be helpful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.69,
          "end": 231.26,
          "en": "And actually that is what I will do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.26,
          "end": 234.21,
          "en": "I will add a couple of data properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.21,
          "end": 236.97,
          "en": "and therefore we need this data option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.97,
          "end": 240.76,
          "en": "in our component configuration object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.76,
          "end": 244.66,
          "en": "and I will start by adding a data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.66,
          "end": 249.033,
          "en": "for this name input I have up here for the username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.11,
          "end": 254.58,
          "en": "So let's go down here and let's add a username field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 254.58,
          "end": 256.7,
          "en": "This name of course is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.7,
          "end": 259,
          "en": "You can name it whatever you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 259,
          "end": 260.21,
          "en": "but I'll name it userName",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.21,
          "end": 262.49,
          "en": "since I'm going to store a username in a here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.49,
          "end": 266.093,
          "en": "And I'll start with an empty string as an initial value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.21,
          "end": 273.21,
          "en": "Now we can bind this with v-model here to this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.69,
          "end": 276.73,
          "en": "And that means that view will automatically detect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.73,
          "end": 280.99,
          "en": "every keystroke, update the value stored in username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 280.99,
          "end": 283.96,
          "en": "but when on the other hand we change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.96,
          "end": 286.99,
          "en": "what's stored in username with our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.99,
          "end": 289.11,
          "en": "For example, when the form is submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.11,
          "end": 291.03,
          "en": "and we reset the value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.03,
          "end": 295.263,
          "en": "then our change will also be reflected in this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 297.12,
          "end": 299,
          "en": "And that's something we can test here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 299,
          "end": 300.91,
          "en": "We're now storing this in userName.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.91,
          "end": 305.683,
          "en": "So now in submitForm, we can of course console log username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 307.58,
          "end": 310.58,
          "en": "So output that we're going to print the username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 310.58,
          "end": 313.87,
          "en": "and then output the concrete values stored in username.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 313.87,
          "end": 316.6,
          "en": "And there after, I'll set this username",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 316.6,
          "end": 318.08299999999997,
          "en": "back to an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 319.59,
          "end": 322.81,
          "en": "Effectively resetting what the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 322.81,
          "end": 327.16,
          "en": "If we now save all of that and open up the developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 327.16,
          "end": 330.12,
          "en": "I can enter Max here in this name field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 330.12,
          "end": 333.98,
          "en": "And if I click save data, you see username Max.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 333.98,
          "end": 336.68,
          "en": "So using the value worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 336.68,
          "end": 339.09000000000003,
          "en": "And you see the input field is empty now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 339.09000000000003,
          "end": 342.453,
          "en": "because I did set username back to an empty string here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 343.64,
          "end": 346.1,
          "en": "And that is all something you learned already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 346.1,
          "end": 347.32,
          "en": "I'm aware of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 347.32,
          "end": 351.21,
          "en": "But this is the foundation of working with user input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 351.21,
          "end": 354.06,
          "en": "Now, let's build up on that foundation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.06,
          "end": 356.2,
          "en": "Let's learn more about v-model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 356.2,
          "end": 358.87,
          "en": "and let's learn how we can extract values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 358.87,
          "end": 361.263,
          "en": "from these other control types here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
